          "domain": "medical",
          "text": "insulin-dependent, X-linked, susceptibility to - MedlinePlus Encyclopedia: Anti-Insulin Antibody Test - MedlinePlus Encyclopedia: Home Blood Sugar Testing - MedlinePlus Health Topic: Islet Cell Transplantation - MedlinePlus Health Topic: Pancreas Transplantation - Type 1 Diabetes in Adults: National Clinical Guideline for Diagnosis and Management in Primary and Secondary Care (2004) - Type 1 Diabetes: Diagnosis and Management of Type 1 Diabetes in Children and Young People (2004) These resources from MedlinePlus offer information about the diagnosis and management of various health conditions: - Diagnostic Tests - Drug Therapy - Surgery and Rehabilitation - Genetic Counseling - Palliative Care",
          "score": 0.013092772206696256,
          "source_url": "https://github.com/abachaa/MedQuAD/tree/577bd37b96c02d1833b2c9eed2de9f96964e96cb",
